silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_04_storage_audit_commuting_square_concrete_anchor_node1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.02_factored_storage_topology.sections.04_storage_audit_commuting_square.concrete_anchor.node1" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_04_storage_audit_commuting_square_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The StoragePacket_CommutingSquare is StoragePacket_Mittens is the top-left node of the storage-audit commuting square. It has a storage arrow going right (to AuditRecord) and a lambda_storage arrow going down (to Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'StoragePacket_Mittens (top-left of commuting square)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_04_storage_audit_commuting_square_concrete_anchor_node2 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.02_factored_storage_topology.sections.04_storage_audit_commuting_square.concrete_anchor.node2" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_04_storage_audit_commuting_square_concrete_anchor_node2 silm:hasLongDescription "The AuditRecord_Mittens_Node is AuditRecord_Mittens is the top-right node — the typed audit record that witnesses the storage event for Mittens. It has a lambda_audit arrow going down to Mittens. It is NOT Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'AuditRecord_Mittens (top-right of commuting square)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_04_storage_audit_commuting_square_concrete_anchor_node3 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.02_factored_storage_topology.sections.04_storage_audit_commuting_square.concrete_anchor.node3" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_04_storage_audit_commuting_square_concrete_anchor_node3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensApex_CommutingSquare is Mittens is the bottom node of the commuting square — the colimit apex that both the lambda_storage and lambda_audit arrows converge to. The square commutes: lambda_audit circ auditedAs = lambda_storage." .
